        <rect x="1100" y="750" width="14" height="8" rx="2" fill="rgba(8, 51, 68, 0.4)" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="1120" y="758" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Frontend</text>

        <rect x="1180" y="750" width="14" height="8" rx="2" fill="rgba(6, 78, 59, 0.4)" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="1200" y="758" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Backend</text>

        <rect x="1260" y="750" width="14" height="8" rx="2" fill="rgba(76, 29, 149, 0.4)" stroke="#a78bfa" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="1280" y="758" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Database</text>

        <rect x="1100" y="766" width="14" height="8" rx="2" fill="rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.3)" stroke="#fb923c" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="1120" y="774" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Queue / Cache</text>

        <rect x="1180" y="766" width="14" height="8" rx="2" fill="rgba(120, 53, 15, 0.3)" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="1200" y="774" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Cloud / Infra</text>

        <rect x="1260" y="766" width="14" height="8" rx="2" fill="rgba(136, 19, 55, 0.4)" stroke="#fb7185" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="1280" y="774" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Security</text>

        <line x1="1100" y1="790" x2="1120" y2="790" stroke="#fb7185" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="5,3"/>
        <text x="1125" y="793" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Async / External</text>

        <line x1="1200" y1="790" x2="1220" y2="790" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="1225" y="793" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">Sync call</text>

        <rect x="1260" y="783" width="14" height="8" rx="2" fill="rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4)" stroke="#a78bfa" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="1280" y="791" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8">ML Inference</text>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <!-- Info Cards -->
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-dot violet"></div>
          <h3>ML Inference Layer (NEW)</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>• LLM Consensus: Claude/Gemini/Groq paralel, 8s timeout, ≥50% threshold</li>
          <li>• Walk-Forward Optimization: 81 kombinasi param, training 4bln → test 2bln</li>
          <li>• Trade Journal Analysis: EWMA real vs backtest, auto-disable underperformers</li>
          <li>• Auto-Backtest: batch scan 11 pairs, scoring otomatis</li>
          <li>• Dispatched via Celery workers untuk non-blocking execution</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-dot orange"></div>
          <h3>Celery Queue (NEW)</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>• Broker: Redis (shared instance dengan cache)</li>
          <li>• Backend: Redis (result storage)</li>
          <li>• Workers: 3 types — inference, backtest, sync</li>
          <li>• Beat Scheduler: periodic auto-backtest, skill update</li>
          <li>• Replaces: in-process setTimeout/setInterval di Express</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-dot orange"></div>
          <h3>Redis Cache (NEW)</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>• Market data cache: rates, symbol info (TTL 1-5s)</li>
          <li>• LLM response cache: avoid re-inference (TTL 5min)</li>
          <li>• Session store: pipeline state, connection status</li>
          <li>• Pub/Sub: real-time pipeline events → frontend SSE</li>
          <li>• Celery broker: task queue + result backend</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-dot violet"></div>
          <h3>Database Split (EXISTING)</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>• MongoDB (Mongoose): user data, trade logs, sessions, skills — 15 collections</li>
          <li>• PostgreSQL (Drizzle): structured analytics, backtest results, migrations</li>
          <li>• Both already wired in codebase, Drizzle config points to PostgreSQL</li>
          <li>• Migration path: MongoDB → PostgreSQL for new structured data</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-dot rose"></div>
          <h3>MT5 Gateway (CONSTRAINT)</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>• Single Python process connection to MT5 terminal</li>
          <li>• MCP stdio bridge from Express (Node.js)</li>
          <li>• AES-256-CBC encrypted credentials</li>
          <li>• Auto-reconnect with 3 retries</li>
          <li>• Bottleneck: only ONE process can hold MT5 terminal connection</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-dot emerald"></div>
          <h3>7 Strategy Modules</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>• SMC · ICT · MSNR · CRT · LIT · Quarterly Theory · Market Structure</li>
          <li>• Confluence Engine: weighted voting across all 7</li>
          <li>• Market Regime Detection: ADX/BB/ATR → dynamic weights</li>
          <li>• Multi-TF verification: M15 → H1 → H4 → D1</li>
          <li>• AI Backtest Skill: symbol rankings + methodology verdicts</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="footer">
      Journal Trade Infrastructure · FORGE DevOps · Generated 2026-07-07 · v1.0
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
